; Closed attention issue115 requires a native seal, executed vectors and exact
; retained-board evidence replay in current canonical push CI. No GDS claim.
; The archive digest is pinned inside the hashed evidence manifest; canonical
; CI executes the pinned verifier against its full raw measurements and checks
; measured source hashes against the accepted source tree. No new board run.
